cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "priya-forecast: symbolic distillation of the PRIYA Lyman-alpha P1D emulator"
abstract: >-
  Distills the PRIYA multi-fidelity Gaussian-process emulator of the Lyman-alpha 1D
  flux power spectrum into per-parameter symbolic equations via PySR, and scores their
  derivative faithfulness (the parameter slope a Fisher forecast depends on), with a
  Sobolev derivative-matching loss to repair unfaithful slopes.
